# Line-ending policy: the repo is LF. A Windows checkout had flipped every
# file to CRLF, which turns one-line edits into whole-file diffs and destroys
# git blame. text=auto + explicit eol=lf makes git store LF regardless of the
# editor; binary entries stop git from ever "normalizing" real binaries.
* text=auto
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.faiss binary
*.pkl  binary